      "formula": "Eγ exp(⟨u,H_y−mη(y)⟩)≤exp(η‖u‖²/2), ∀u,y; equivalently Eγexp(t⟨a,H_y−mη(y)⟩)≤exp(ηt²‖a‖²/2), ∀a∈R^d, ∀t∈R",
      "parents": [
        "GAUSSIAN-CONCENTRATION-BACKGROUND",
